---
// The old address of the Our programs page. Forwards visitors to /programs,
// keeping any #program anchor (e.g. /activities#badminton-camp).
//
// The site is hosted on GitHub Pages, which can't send real (301) redirects,
// so this page does it in the browser: a script keeps the anchor, and the meta
// refresh covers visitors without JavaScript (they land at the top of the page).
// public/_redirects does a proper 301 instead if the site moves to Cloudflare Pages.
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>Our programs | R Journey</title>
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="/programs" />
    <script is:inline>
      location.replace('/programs' + location.search + location.hash);
    </script>
    <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0; url=/programs" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <p>This page has moved to <a href="/programs">Our programs</a>.</p>
  </body>
</html>
